## 1. Business write + event in one transaction
   concept: orders row and outbox row commit together; the app does not talk to Kafka
   outbox <- OrderPlaced event_id=1bbd86f7-7e21-47f0-b45e-40a987d181e5

## 2. Next state change, next event
   concept: each event is a row waiting for the relay (published_at IS NULL)
   outbox <- OrderPaid event_id=2adb9ceb-38de-4285-b9a0-a2c4b4af564c

## 3. Rollback drops the event too
   concept: business write fails -> whole transaction rolls back -> no outbox row to publish
   outbox <- OrderPlaced event_id=8eee784b-6894-48ce-b693-df59b8124f7b
   rejected: payment provider down, order 2 aborted

